# Build output; the device binary is produced by `make videod`.
#
# Anchored to this directory on purpose: a bare "videod" pattern also matched
# cmd/videod/ and silently kept the service entry point out of version control,
# which is why the Makefile referenced a path no clone ever contained.
/videod
/videod-arm64

# Runtime state when `make run` is used with a scratch data dir.
/data/
